{"sha": "2dde5dd554aa04cd8291cc8c011f180badd316a9972c8630521091b52d5ade43", "body": ["\\chapter{二次函数与二次方程}\\label{ch:g11:quad}", "", "二次函数是继一次函数之后最简单的函数，也是", "首个图像真正弯曲的函数。本章建立关于它们的完整工具：", "顶点式、判别式、二次式的符号，以及", "抛物线的几何性质。", "", "\\section{顶点式}", "", "\\begin{definition}[二次函数]\\label{def:g11:quad:quadratic}", "形如下式的函数称为\\emph{二次函数}\\index{二次函数}，", "即", "\\[", "f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c, \\qquad a \\neq 0,", "\\]", "其中 $a$、$b$、$c$ 为实数。式子 $ax^2 + bx + c$", "也称为\\emph{二次三项式}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[顶点式]\\label{thm:g11:quad:canonical}", "每个二次函数都能唯一地写成", "\\[", "f(x) = a(x - \\alpha)^2 + \\beta,", "\\qquad\\text{其中 } \\alpha = -\\frac{b}{2a} \\text{ 且 } \\beta = f(\\alpha).", "\\]", "\\emph{顶点式}\\index{顶点式}即 $f$ 的上述表达式。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "用\\emph{配方法}。由 $a \\neq 0$，", "将其提出前两项：", "\\[", "ax^2 + bx + c = a\\left(x^2 + \\frac{b}{a}x\\right) + c .", "\\]", "现在 $x^2 + \\frac{b}{a}x$ 是平方式的前两项，", "$\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 = x^2 + \\frac ba x + \\frac{b^2}{4a^2}$,", "故 $x^2 + \\frac{b}{a}x = \\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 -", "\\frac{b^2}{4a^2}$。代入得：", "\\[", "f(x) = a\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 - \\frac{b^2}{4a} + c", "= a\\bigl(x - \\alpha\\bigr)^2 + \\beta,", "\\]", "其中 $\\alpha = -\\frac{b}{2a}$，$\\beta = c - \\frac{b^2}{4a}$。", "取 $x = \\alpha$，平方项为零，故 $\\beta = f(\\alpha)$。唯一性：", "将 $a(x-\\alpha)^2 + \\beta$ 展开，比较", "$x$ 的系数可得 $\\alpha = -\\frac{b}{2a}$，进而 $\\beta$ 被唯一确定。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:quad:canonical}", "设 $f(x) = 2x^2 - 8x + 3$，则 $\\alpha = -\\frac{-8}{2 \\times 2} = 2$，且", "$\\beta = f(2) = 8 - 16 + 3 = -5$，故", "\\[", "f(x) = 2(x - 2)^2 - 5 .", "\\]", "展开验证：$2(x^2 - 4x + 4) - 5 = 2x^2 - 8x + 8 - 5 =", "2x^2 - 8x + 3$.", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[极值与单调性]\\label{prop:g11:quad:variations}", "设 $f(x) = a(x-\\alpha)^2 + \\beta$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $a > 0$，则 $f$ 在 $\\intoc{-\\infty}{\\alpha}$ 上递减，且", "        在 $\\intco{\\alpha}{+\\infty}$ 上递增：$f$ 有\\emph{最小值}", "        $\\beta$，在 $x = \\alpha$ 处取得。", "  \\item 若 $a < 0$，则单调性相反：$f$ 有\\emph{最大值}", "        $\\beta$，在 $x = \\alpha$ 处取得。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $a > 0$，取 $\\alpha \\leq u < v$。则", "\\[", "f(v) - f(u) = a\\bigl((v-\\alpha)^2 - (u-\\alpha)^2\\bigr)", "= a\\,(v - u)\\,\\bigl((v-\\alpha) + (u-\\alpha)\\bigr).", "\\]", "各因式均为正：$a > 0$，$v - u > 0$，且", "$(v-\\alpha) + (u-\\alpha) > 0$（因为 $v > \\alpha$，$u \\geq \\alpha$）。于是", "$f(v) > f(u)$，即 $f$ 在 $\\intco{\\alpha}{+\\infty}$ 上递增。对于", "$u < v \\leq \\alpha$ 时，最后一个因式为负，故 $f(v) < f(u)$，即 $f$", "在该区间上递减。最后，$f(x) - f(\\alpha) = a(x-\\alpha)^2 \\geq 0$ 对", "所有 $x$ 成立，故 $\\beta = f(\\alpha)$ 为最小值。$a < 0$ 的情形由", "上述结论应用于 $-f$ 即可得出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "某农夫有 $100$ 米篱笆，用来围一块紧靠直墙的矩形田地", "（靠墙一侧无需篱笆）。若 $x$ 为宽度，则", "围成面积为 $A(x) = x(100 - 2x) = -2x^2 + 100x$。此时 $\\alpha =", "-\\frac{100}{2\\times(-2)} = 25$，且 $A(25) = 25 \\times 50 = 1250$：面积", "在宽为 $25$ m 时最大，为 $1250$ m$^2$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{根与因式分解}", "", "\\begin{definition}[根、判别式]\\label{def:g11:quad:discriminant}", "\\emph{根}\\index{根}指二次三项式 $ax^2+bx+c$ 所对应的", "方程 $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ 的解。二次三项式的\\emph{判别式}\\index{判别式}", "为如下的数：", "\\[", "\\Delta = b^2 - 4ac .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[解方程 $ax^2+bx+c=0$]\\label{thm:g11:quad:roots}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $\\Delta > 0$，则方程有两个不相等的根", "        \\[", "        x_1 = \\frac{-b - \\sqrt{\\Delta}}{2a},", "        \\qquad", "        x_2 = \\frac{-b + \\sqrt{\\Delta}}{2a},", "        \\]", "        且 $ax^2+bx+c = a(x - x_1)(x - x_2)$。", "  \\item 若 $\\Delta = 0$，则方程有唯一的根", "        $x_0 = -\\frac{b}{2a}$，且 $ax^2+bx+c = a(x - x_0)^2$。", "  \\item 若 $\\Delta < 0$，则方程无实数解，且", "        该二次三项式不能分解为实系数的因式。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}